questions.solution_text:
Split the cross-section into two rectangles.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.45]
\draw (0,0)--(10,0)--(10,4)--(4,4)--(4,9)--(0,9)--cycle;
\draw[dashed] (4,0)--(4,4);
\node at (7,2) {$40\text{ mm}^{2}$};
\node at (2,6.5) {$20\text{ mm}^{2}$};
\draw (0,0)--(10,0) node[midway,below] {$10\text{ mm}$};
\draw (10,0)--(10,4) node[midway,right] {$4\text{ mm}$};
\draw (0,9)--(0,0) node[midway,left] {$9\text{ mm}$};
\draw (4,9)--(0,9) node[midway,above] {$4\text{ mm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
$A = (10 \times 4) + (4 \times 5)$
$= 60\text{ mm}^{2}$
$V = Ah$
$= 60 \times 5$
$= 300\text{ mm}^{3}$
